 begin="00:54.360" end="00:57.420"><span begin="00:54.360" end="00:54.630">In </span><span begin="00:54.630" end="00:54.720">a </span><span begin="00:54.720" end="00:55.230">race </span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.350">to </span><span begin="00:55.350" end="00:55.770">make </span><span begin="00:55.770" end="00:56.430">ends </span><span begin="00:56.430" end="00:57.420">meet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.870" end="01:01.980"><span begin="00:57.870" end="00:58.050">And </span><span begin="00:58.050" end="00:58.500">he </span><span begin="00:58.500" end="01:00.540">will </span><span begin="01:00.540" end="01:01.050">play </span><span begin="01:01.050" end="01:01.980">God</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.100" end="01:11.760"><span begin="01:08.100" end="01:08.250">And </span><span begin="01:08.250" end="01:08.700">he </span><span begin="01:08.700" end="01:10.650">will </span><span begin="01:10.650" end="01:11.190">play </span><span begin="01:11.190" end="01:11.760">God</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.920" end="01:19.410"><span begin="01:16.920" end="01:17.190">Am </span><span begin="01:17.190" end="01:17.370">I </span><span begin="01:17.370" end="01:19.110">mistaken</span><span begin="01:19.110" end="01:19.410">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.410" end="01:21.300"><span begin="01:19.410" end="01:19.680">We're </span><span begin="01:19.680" end="01:20.070">already </span><span begin="01:20.070" end="01:21.300">braking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.300" end="01:24.330"><span begin="01:21.300" end="01:21.780">Under </span><span begin="01:21.780" end="01:22.170">weight </span><span begin="01:22.170" end="01:22.650">from </span><span begin="01:22.650" end="01:22.800">the </span><span begin="01:22.800" end="01:23.130">long </span><span begin="01:23.130" end="01:24.330">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.660" end="01:27.000"><span begin="01:24.660" end="01:24.990">That </span><span begin="01:24.990" end="01:25